# Ship stories: push and merge

When a sprint story (bmad-build) is committed and ready to ship:

1. Push the feature branch and open a PR (conventional title/body).
2. Merge the PR into `main` (`gh pr merge --merge --delete-branch`).
3. Fast-forward local `main` to `origin/main`.

Do **not** ask “want me to push/merge?” — the user prefers this every time unless they explicitly say not to for that story.
